Randomly teleports all enemies within a radius of three.  Enemies will be teleported between [4, 5, 6, 7, 8 (TL1-5; PARADOX 300)] and [8, 10, 12, 14, 16 (TL1-5; PARADOX 300)] tiles from you and may be stunned, blinded, confused, or pinned for [2, 2, 3, 3, 4 (TL1-5; PARADOX 300)] turns.

The chance of teleportion will scale with your Spellpower.
